@EliBenSasson I'm at &lt; 10% there's no pubkey encryption at all.

But there is a realistic world where pubkey encryption will have to be in a bigkey regime: a 2**30 size object to resist a 2**120 complexity attack.

(P=NP is still *potentially* compatible with cryptography for this reason!)

